{"id": "1534496037127852042", "channel_id": "1534496037127852042", "author_id": "1437487264023318668", "author_name": "vxvendetta97", "content": "The description for the special Chaos Realm is outdated and just very badly explained.\n- **1)** It say that the team Keyflare don't decay, but in reality now it does. And the keyflare generated is (team AVERAGE Keyflare Regen x 3) + 100.\n- **2)** You need to add that the realm don't activate the **Chaos Symbiosis** effects too.\n- **3)** It talks about taking Posses that come \"from hand\" but is just from the ones you have unlocked. It also say that they take them from the set of new special Posses, but is not like that, they are just added to the poll that you have, and it doesn't even say what they do or how many there are (not a must to specify that, but at least clarify how it really work)\n\nPlease fix", "timestamp": "2026-08-05T09:39:24.809000+00:00", "thread_id": "1534496037127852042", "edited_timestamp": "2026-08-05T09:40:33.311000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1534496037354340563", "filename": "image.png", "content_type": "image/webp", "size": 141170, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1534496037127852042/1534496037354340563/image.png?ex=6a74ff0c&is=6a73ad8c&hm=23fb23911f7d0444ef973cac5a443a76510f5899ee3dd1c5c2bd0cc5650d6a10&"}], "thread_title": "Primordia: Chaos text explanation is very bad", "forum_channel_id": "1180845276823564288", "thread_tags": ["1181168103141416960", "1361168893200044183"], "is_thread_starter": true}
